      "servings": 4,
      "ingredient_candidates_original": [
        "Preheat oven to 400°F. Mince garlic.",
        "Trim and discard skin of ginger and",
        "mince. Peel potatoes and cut into 1-inch",
        "dice. Rinse seallions. Trim and discard",
        "roots. Thinly slice, keeping whites and",
        "light greens separate from dark greens.",
        "Rinse broccoli. Break into 2-inch florets",
        "with stems. Pat beef dry with paper",
        "towel. In a small bowl, combine ketchup",
        "and % of hoisin sauce to make glaze. In",
        "a separate smail bowl, beat 1 egg.",
        "4. Boil Potatoes",
        "While meatloaves and broccoli roast,",
        "add potatoes to a medium pot, cover",
        "with cold water, and add a generous",
        "pinch salt. Bring to a boil over high heat",
        "and cook until tender when pierced",
        "with a knife tip, about 12 minutes. Drain",
        "and return to pot, off the heat.",
        "2. Form Meatloaves",
        "In a large bowl, combine soy sauce,",
        "breadcrumbs, garlic, beef, % of ginger,",
        "‘4 of scallion whites and light greens, 4",
        "of beaten egg, remaining hoisin sauce,",
        "and 1 teaspoon kosher salt. Using your",
        "hands, mix well (see Recipe Tip). Divide",
        "mixture evenly and form into 2 loaves,",
        "about 2 x 5 inches. Place on % of a foil-",
        "lined baking sheet. Brush over ketchup-",
        "hoisin glaze, dividing evenly. Add",
        "remaining egg to an omelet tomorrow.",
        "5. Mash Potatoes",
        "Add miso paste to pot with potatoes.",
        "Using a large fork or potato masher,",
        "mash until mostly smooth. Stir in",
        "remaining scallion whites and light",
        "greens and remaining sesame oil. Taste",
        "and add salt and pepper as needed.",
        "3. Roast Meatloaves",
        "In a large bowl, toss broccoli with 1%",
        "tablespoons sesame oil, remaining",
        "ginger, % teaspoon kosher salt, and",
        "pepper. Arrange in a single layer on",
        "other 4 of prepared baking sheet.",
        "Transfer to oven and roast together",
        "until meatloaves are cooked through",
        "and broccoli is tender, about 15",
        "minutes.",
        "6. Plate Meatloaves",
        "Cut meatloaves crosswise into thick,",
        "hearty slices. Garnish with scallion dark",
        "greens. Serve with roasted broccoli and",
        "mashed potatoes alongside. Dig in!",
        "Join the Plated community - post your",
        "#platedpics this week! OV",
        "Q- RECIPE TIPS",
        "Be sure to read through the entire recipe",
        "before you begin cooking.",
        "Hands are great kitchen tools, especially",
        "to form perfect meatloaves. Incorporate",
        "your hands prevents over mixing and",
        "ensures a softer touch.",
        "2 cloves garlic",
        "% inch ginger, divided",
        "10 ounces Yukon Gold potatoes",
        "4 scallions, divided",
        "8 ounces broccoli",
        "12 ounces ground beef",
